# Giving up costs the dnf points. In last chance only the player who passed the
# fewest checkpoints loses them, which eliminates c. s only watches.
settings {"starting_points": 10, "last_chance_dnf_mode": "only_least_checkpoints"}
maps m1:10/10/10
players a b c
watchers s
round a 30 | b dnf 2 | c dnf 1
round a 30 | b dnf 2 | c dnf 1
round a 30 | b 32
